# ============================================================
# Airbnb Spa Booking — API Test Requests
# ============================================================
# Use with VS Code REST Client extension (humao.rest-client)
# or any HTTP client that supports .http files.
# ============================================================

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@adminAuth = Basic admin:admin123
@userAuth = Basic user:password

### ============================================================
### PUBLIC ENDPOINTS (no authentication required)
### ============================================================

### Get property info
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/property

### Get equipment
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/equipment

### Get prices
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/prices

### Get availability
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/availability?startDate=2026-07-20&endDate=2026-08-20

### Create booking request (anonymous)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/public/booking-requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Jean",
  "lastName": "Dupont",
  "email": "jean@example.com",
  "phone": "0612345678",
  "startDate": "2026-08-15",
  "endDate": "2026-08-18",
  "numberOfGuests": 2,
  "bookingType": "NIGHT_STAY",
  "message": "Sejour détente",
  "agreedToRules": true
}

### ============================================================
### USER ENDPOINTS (requires user authentication)
### ============================================================

### Login (get profile with Basic Auth)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/user/profile
Authorization: {{userAuth}}

### Get my bookings
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/user/bookings
Authorization: {{userAuth}}

### ============================================================
### ADMIN ENDPOINTS (requires admin authentication)
### ============================================================

### Get dashboard
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/dashboard
Authorization: {{adminAuth}}

### Get all bookings
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/bookings
Authorization: {{adminAuth}}

### Get users
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/users
Authorization: {{adminAuth}}

### Get prices
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/prices
Authorization: {{adminAuth}}

### Get equipment
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/equipment
Authorization: {{adminAuth}}

### Get availability blocks
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/availability-blocks
Authorization: {{adminAuth}}

### ============================================================
### SECURITY TEST CASES
### ============================================================

### Should return 401 — no authentication (user endpoint)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/user/profile

### Should return 401 — no authentication (admin endpoint)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/dashboard

### Should return 403 — user attempting to access admin endpoint
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/dashboard
Authorization: {{userAuth}}
